PASS  stop-gradient keeps the teacher out of the backward pass
PASS  positive reward exactly when the teacher likes the token more   | teacher 0.0037 vs student 0.0007
PASS  clipping is what tames the rare-token blow-up   | unclipped -20.0 -> -2.0
```

